gnome-initial-setup (50.0-0ubuntu3) resolute; urgency=medium

  [ Sergio Costas Rodriguez ]
  * accessibility: Hide focus ring when changing between pages.
    The new focusable bin can show a focus ring around. Unfortunately,
    sometimes it is shown after a page switch even if the keyboard
    isn't being used. (LP: #2146315)
  * accessibility: replace ActionRow+Switch with SwitchRow.
    The insights and the privacy pages use currently an Adw.ActionRow
    with an internal Gtk.Switch. This is cumbersome for accessibility
    because the role isn't being notified, and the navigation can be
    odd unless some tricks are used. (LP: #2146436)
  * pro: Fix the text alignment in the Ubuntu Pro presentation page.
    (LP: #2146323)
  * Use external browser to activate Ubuntu Pro

  [ Marco Trevisan (Treviño) ]
  * d/p/welcome-page: Update the release notes page to reflect new docs URI
    (LP: #2146935)

